  "title": "GrubMarket Expands into the UK with the Acquisition of JR Holland",
  "summary": "We are thrilled to announce that GrubMarket has completed the acquisition of JR Holland, one of the leading fresh produce and foodservice distributors serving North East England and Scotland. This strategic acquisition marks GrubMarket’s first entry into the UK and represents an important milestone as we continue expanding our global market presence and driving technology […]",
